<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>ITS THE raf strafe BOIIS   &lt;i am just doing for some extended time but working 100%&gt;</Major>
    <Description>IN ORDER TO run properly u need to do these &lt;better to put readonly for that 2 cfg files&gt; ( u can use like holding or do until)    ( u can bind this to any keys i like to put in mouse4/5)

go to the cgf folder in apex legends &lt;origin / steam&gt;
create a cfg and name it as                                          &lt;autoexec.cfg&gt;
then in steam or origin paste this command                   &lt;+exec autoexec.cfg&gt; 
now open your autoexec and paste this                       &lt;exec raf.cfg&gt;

now create a cgf and  name it as &lt;raf.cfg&gt;
now paste this commands in that raf.cfg
                                                                         bind_US_standard "MWHEELUP" "+jump; +moveright; +forward" 0
                                                                         bind_US_standard "MWHEELDOWN" "+jump; +moveleft; +forward" 0</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 12 1
Delay 50 ms
WheelUp 1
Delay 50 ms
WheelUp 1
Delay 60 ms
WheelUp 1
Delay 60 ms
WheelDown 1
Delay 50 ms
WheelDown 1
Delay 60 ms
WheelDown 1
Goto 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>